</node>
<node id="Ethernet">
  <data key="d0">Ethernet</data>
  <data key="d1">connection</data>
  <data key="d2">Ethernet is the physical network medium over which the EL 4.0 provides Modbus TCP communication for control and monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b04ddc1618376e2d935f2885e7799a35</data>
  <data key="d4">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792057803</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Electrolyser Stack">
  <data key="d0">Electrolyser Stack</data>
  <data key="d1">component</data>
  <data key="d2">The electrolyser stack is the stackable electrolysis assembly of the EL 4.0; performance degradation is suggested over stack lifetime by heat dissipation increasing from 0.6 kW at beginning of life to 0.9 kW maximum at end of life.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b04ddc1618376e2d935f2885e7799a35</data>
  <data key="d4">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792057803</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SITRANS P320">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS P320</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">SITRANS P320 is a model of the SITRANS P pressure transmitter family. It has a high measuring accuracy of 0.065%, is developed according to IEC61508 standards for SIL2/3, features an improved HMI display with NAMUR NE107, and supports remote safety handling. It is ready for digitalization.&lt;SEP&gt;SITRANS P320 is a digital pressure transmitter for measurement of gauge pressure, absolute pressure, differential pressure, flow, and level. It has high measuring accuracy of 0.065%, is developed according to IEC61508 standards for SIL2/3, has improved HMI display with NAMUR NE107, 4-key operation, and remote safety handling. It is intended for chemical, oil &amp; gas, energy, shipbuilding, mechanical engineering, and water/wastewater industries.&lt;SEP&gt;Siemens pressure transmitter mentioned in the surrounding context. In comparison with SITRANS P420, it cites IEC61508 SIL2/3, NAMUR NE107 HMI, 4-key operation, remote safety handling, and digitalization readiness. It has a measurement accuracy of 0.065% and includes water/wastewater in its industry list.&lt;SEP&gt;SITRANS P320 is a digital pressure transmitter for measurement of gauge pressure, absolute pressure, differential pressure, flow, and level. SITRANS P320 supports gauge pressure, absolute pressure, and differential pressure; measuring span 1 mbar to 700 bar; communication 4...20 mA/HART®, PROFIBUS PA, FOUNDATION Fieldbus (in preparation); accuracy 0.065%; max. turndown 100:1; long-term stability 0.125% / 5 years; measured medium temperature -40 °C to +100 °C; certificates/approvals ATEX, Exia/ib, Exd, FM is/xp, CSA is/xp, NEPSI, SIL, ...; diaphragm materials stainless steel, hastelloy, tantalum, monel, gold; special features remote safety handling.&lt;SEP&gt;SITRANS P320 is a SITRANS pressure transmitter referenced in the SITRANS FP differential pressure sensor communication and approvals as As P320 and as part of the preceding SITRANS product comparison.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572c717a6680b77ac4993917925a97b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6086d150f1c9fad29deb5294d8a5301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcd5a3f5ccd64668dc63bd83e6959a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a54c7cc3fd1b24440332f3b903c96434</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059348</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SITRANS P420">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS P420</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">SITRANS P420 is a digital pressure transmitter as “high performance” version of the P320 for gauge and differential pressure measurements. It has accuracy 0.04%, measuring span 1 mbar to 700 bar, communication 4...20 mA/HART®, PROFIBUS PA, FOUNDATION Fieldbus (in preparation), max turndown 100:1, long-term stability 0.125% / 5 years, measured medium temperature -40 °C to +100 °C, and special features remote safety handling and ready for digitalization.&lt;SEP&gt;Siemens pressure transmitter in the SITRANS P420 product family. It has a high measurement accuracy of 0.04%, is developed according to IEC61508 standards for SIL2/3, has an improved HMI display with NAMUR NE107, supports 4-key operation, remote safety handling, and is ready for digitalization. Listed industries include chemical, oil &amp; gas, energy, shipbuilding, and mechanical engineering.&lt;SEP&gt;SITRANS P420 is a digital pressure transmitter described as the "high performance" version of the P320 for gauge and differential pressure measurements. SITRANS P420 supports gauge pressure, absolute pressure, and differential pressure; measuring span 1 mbar to 700 bar; communication 4...20 mA/HART®, PROFIBUS PA, FOUNDATION Fieldbus (in preparation); accuracy 0.04%; max. turndown 100:1; long-term stability 0.125% / 5 years; measured medium temperature -40 °C to +100 °C; certificates/approvals ATEX, Exia/ib, Exd, FM is/xp, CSA is/xp, NEPSI, SIL, ...; diaphragm materials stainless steel, hastelloy, tantalum, monel, gold; special features remote safety handling and ready for digitalization.&lt;SEP&gt;SITRANS P420 is a SITRANS pressure transmitter in the preceding Page 9 comparison table of high-performance and compact hygienic pressure transmitters.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6086d150f1c9fad29deb5294d8a5301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcd5a3f5ccd64668dc63bd83e6959a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a54c7cc3fd1b24440332f3b903c96434</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059337</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SITRANS P300">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS P300</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">SITRANS P300 is a digital pressure transmitter for complex hygienic applications. It measures gauge pressure and absolute pressure, with measuring span 10 mbar to 400 bar, communication 4...20 mA/HART®, PROFIBUS PA, FOUNDATION Fieldbus, accuracy 0.075%, max turndown 100:1, long-term stability 0.25% / 5 years, and measured medium temperature -40 °C to +200 °C.&lt;SEP&gt;The SITRANS P300 is a Siemens pressure transmitter designed for hygienic applications, available with more than 90 process connections. It is ideally suited for external cleaning with high protection classes IP68 and IP69K, features all current hygiene, material, and calibration certificates, and has low measurement errors even at high temperatures. Its target industries are food &amp; beverage and pharmaceuticals. Per the Page 9 technical data table it has an accuracy of 0.075%, measuring span of 10 mbar to 400 bar, maximum turndown of 100:1, long-term stability of 0.25%/5 years, medium temperature range of -40 °C to +200 °C, and ATEX/Exia/ib/FM/CSA/NEPSI approvals.&lt;SEP&gt;SITRANS P300 is a digital pressure transmitter for complex hygienic applications. SITRANS P300 supports gauge pressure and absolute pressure; measuring span 10 mbar to 400 bar; communication 4...20 mA/HART®, PROFIBUS PA, FOUNDATION Fieldbus; accuracy 0.075%; max. turndown 100:1; long-term stability 0.25% / 5 years; measured medium temperature -40 °C to +200 °C; certificates/approvals ATEX, Exia/ib, FM is/xp, CSA is/xp, NEPSI, ...; diaphragm materials stainless steel, hastelloy.&lt;SEP&gt;SITRANS P300 is a SITRANS pressure transmitter in the preceding Page 9 comparison table of high-performance and compact hygienic pressure transmitters.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28929d6541ccd9fbfd6be3e69287bec9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcd5a3f5ccd64668dc63bd83e6959a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a54c7cc3fd1b24440332f3b903c96434</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059397</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SITRANS P Compact">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS P Compact</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">SITRANS P Compact is a pressure transmitter for hygienic applications for measuring gauge and absolute pressure. It features a wide range of aseptic process connections, space-saving transmitter thanks to compact enclosure, easy cleaning, and process temperatures up to 200 °C possible. It is intended for food &amp; beverage and pharmaceuticals industries.&lt;SEP&gt;Hygienic Siemens pressure transmitter matching the unlabeled hygienic cell. It features a wide range of aseptic process connections, is a space-saving transmitter due to its compact enclosure, supports easy cleaning, has process temperatures up to 200 °C, and is listed for food &amp; beverage and pharmaceuticals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6086d150f1c9fad29deb5294d8a5301</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059349</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SITRANS P200">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS P200</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">SITRANS P200 is a pressure transmitter variant with gauge and absolute pressure measurement using a ceramic diaphragm for medium measuring ranges up to 60 bar. It is intended for mechanical engineering, shipbuilding, and energy industries.&lt;SEP&gt;Gauge and absolute pressure transmitter with ceramic diaphragm for medium measuring ranges up to 60 bar.&lt;SEP&gt;SITRANS P200 is a SITRANS model referenced on the surrounding page outside the comparison table, with low mH2O ranges.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6086d150f1c9fad29deb5294d8a5301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcd5a3f5ccd64668dc63bd83e6959a69</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059340</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SITRANS P210">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS P210</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">SITRANS P210 is a pressure transmitter variant with gauge and absolute pressure measurement using a stainless-steel diaphragm for low measuring ranges up to 600 mbar. It is intended for mechanical engineering, shipbuilding, and energy industries.&lt;SEP&gt;Gauge and absolute pressure transmitter with stainless-steel diaphragm for low measuring ranges up to 600 mbar.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6086d150f1c9fad29deb5294d8a5301</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059346</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SITRANS P220">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS P220</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">SITRANS P220 is a pressure transmitter variant with gauge and absolute pressure measurement using a fully welded stainless-steel diaphragm for high measuring ranges up to 1,000 bar. It is intended for mechanical engineering, shipbuilding, and energy industries.&lt;SEP&gt;Gauge and absolute pressure transmitter with fully welded stainless-steel diaphragm for high measuring ranges up to 1,000 bar.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6086d150f1c9fad29deb5294d8a5301</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059347</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SITRANS LH100">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS LH100</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">SITRANS LH100 is a product designation referenced by the Siemens website URL www.siemens.com/sitranslh100 in the source.&lt;SEP&gt;SITRANS LH100 is a SITRANS model referenced on the surrounding page outside the comparison table, with low mH2O ranges.&lt;SEP&gt;SITRANS LH100 is a pressure transmitter for measuring hydrostatic levels. It measures level with a span of 0–3 mH₂O to 0–20 mH₂O, uses 4...20 mA communication, has 0.3% accuracy, 0.25%/year long-term stability, a measured medium temperature range of -10 °C to +80 °C, approvals ATEX, Exia, IEC Ex, EAC, UL, WRAS, and a ceramic diaphragm material. No special features are listed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcd5a3f5ccd64668dc63bd83e6959a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a54c7cc3fd1b24440332f3b903c96434</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059461</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SITRANS LH300">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS LH300</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">SITRANS LH300 is a product designation referenced by the Siemens website URL www.siemens.com/sitranslh300 in the source.&lt;SEP&gt;The SITRANS LH300 is a model in the SITRANS LH100, LH300 pressure transmitter family with an outer diameter of 26 mm.&lt;SEP&gt;SITRANS LH300 is a SITRANS model referenced on the surrounding page outside the comparison table, with low mH2O ranges.&lt;SEP&gt;SITRANS LH300 is a submersible sensor for hydrostatic level measurement. It measures level with a span of 0–1 mH₂O to 0–40 mH₂O, uses 4...20 mA communication, has 0.15% accuracy, 0.15%/year long-term stability, a measured medium temperature range of -10 °C to +80 °C, approvals ATEX, Exia, IEC Ex, EAC, UL, WRAS, and a ceramic diaphragm material. It has the best accuracy and long-term stability among the four columns and a wider low-range level span than LH100. No special features are listed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28929d6541ccd9fbfd6be3e69287bec9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcd5a3f5ccd64668dc63bd83e6959a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a54c7cc3fd1b24440332f3b903c96434</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059395</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SITRANS FP">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS FP</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">SITRANS FP is a product designation referenced by the Siemens website URL www.siemens.com/sitransfp in the source.&lt;SEP&gt;SITRANS FP is a SITRANS model referenced on the surrounding page outside the comparison table, with low mH2O ranges.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcd5a3f5ccd64668dc63bd83e6959a69</data>
