<node id="NAMUR NE107">
  <data key="d0">NAMUR NE107</data>
  <data key="d1">standard</data>
  <data key="d2">NAMUR NE107 is a standard for improved HMI display, featured in SITRANS P320.&lt;SEP&gt;NAMUR NE107 is a standard referenced for the improved HMI display, indicating larger, new, and improved display characteristics.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard associated with the improved HMI display on SITRANS P420 and cited for SITRANS P320.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572c717a6680b77ac4993917925a97b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6086d150f1c9fad29deb5294d8a5301</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059361</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="IEC61508">
  <data key="d0">IEC61508</data>
  <data key="d1">standard</data>
  <data key="d2">IEC61508 is a standard for safety-related systems, according to which SITRANS P transmitters are developed for SIL2/3 applications.&lt;SEP&gt;IEC61508 is a standard according to which SITRANS P320 is developed for SIL2/3.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard according to which SITRANS P420 is developed for SIL2/3; also cited for SITRANS P320 in the surrounding context.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572c717a6680b77ac4993917925a97b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6086d150f1c9fad29deb5294d8a5301</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059358</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SIL2/3">
  <data key="d0">SIL2/3</data>
  <data key="d1">safetyrequirement</data>
  <data key="d2">SIL2/3 is a certification level according to which SITRANS P transmitters are certified for safety-related applications.&lt;SEP&gt;SIL2/3 is a safety integrity level requirement associated with SITRANS P320 development according to IEC61508.&lt;SEP&gt;Safety integrity requirement cited for SITRANS P420 and SITRANS P320 from IEC61508 standards.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572c717a6680b77ac4993917925a97b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6086d150f1c9fad29deb5294d8a5301</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059362</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="EN IEC 62828-1">
  <data key="d0">EN IEC 62828-1</data>
  <data key="d1">standard</data>
  <data key="d2">EN IEC 62828-1 is a standard referenced for conformity error of the pressure transmitters.&lt;SEP&gt;EN IEC 62828-1 is the standard defining accuracy as conformity error, referenced by the accuracy footnote in the table.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcd5a3f5ccd64668dc63bd83e6959a69</data>
