  <data key="d0">FOUNDATION Fieldbus</data>
  <data key="d1">controlsystem</data>
  <data key="d2">FOUNDATION Fieldbus is a communication standard supported by SITRANS P transmitters for digital communication.&lt;SEP&gt;FOUNDATION Fieldbus is a communication protocol supported by SITRANS P420, SITRANS P320, and SITRANS P300; for P420 and P320 it is listed as in preparation.&lt;SEP&gt;FOUNDATION Fieldbus is a communication protocol mentioned as included in the preceding SITRANS table for other SITRANS products, not for SITRANS P200/210/220, LH100, or LH300.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572c717a6680b77ac4993917925a97b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a54c7cc3fd1b24440332f3b903c96434</data>
