<node id="Stainless Steel">
  <data key="d0">Stainless Steel</data>
  <data key="d1">substance</data>
  <data key="d2">Stainless steel is a diaphragm material listed for SITRANS P420, SITRANS P320, SITRANS P300, and SITRANS P Compact.&lt;SEP&gt;Stainless steel is a diaphragm material used by SITRANS P200/210/220 and SITRANS FP differential pressure sensor.</data>
