  <data key="d1">substance</data>
  <data key="d2">Hastelloy is a diaphragm material listed for SITRANS P420, SITRANS P320, and SITRANS P300.&lt;SEP&gt;Hastelloy is a diaphragm material used by SITRANS FP differential pressure sensor, but not for the membrane.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a54c7cc3fd1b24440332f3b903c96434</data>
