  <data key="d2">Ceramic is a diaphragm material used in SITRANS P200 for medium measuring ranges.&lt;SEP&gt;Ceramic is a diaphragm material used by SITRANS P200/210/220, SITRANS LH100, and SITRANS LH300.</data>
