<node id="HMI Display">
  <data key="d0">HMI Display</data>
  <data key="d1">component</data>
  <data key="d2">The HMI display is a larger, new, and improved display with NAMUR NE107 featured on SITRANS P transmitters.&lt;SEP&gt;The HMI display is a larger, new, and improved display with NAMUR NE107, associated with SITRANS P320.&lt;SEP&gt;Improved HMI display on SITRANS P420, described as larger, new, and improved with NAMUR NE107; also cited for SITRANS P320 in the surrounding context.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572c717a6680b77ac4993917925a97b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6086d150f1c9fad29deb5294d8a5301</data>
