  <data key="d1">component</data>
  <data key="d2">A ceramic diaphragm is used in SITRANS P200 for medium measuring ranges up to 60 bar.&lt;SEP&gt;Diaphragm used by SITRANS P200 for gauge and absolute pressure measurement in medium measuring ranges up to 60 bar.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6086d150f1c9fad29deb5294d8a5301</data>
