<node id="SITRANS P">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS P</data>
  <data key="d1">instrument</data>
  <data key="d2">SITRANS P is a complete family of pressure transmitters for measuring gauge, differential, and absolute pressure. It offers a range of performance values, load capacities, and materials, with high measuring accuracy from 0.04% to 0.3%. It supports safety-related applications with certifications according to SIL2 and SIL2/3, and communicates via 4...20mA, HART, PROFIBUS PA, and FOUNDATION Fieldbus. It integrates with SIMATIC PCS 7 and SIMATIC PDM, and can be configured via PIA Portal. It stores 1,500 measured values and supports remote safety handling.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-572c717a6680b77ac4993917925a97b7</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792058702</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Siemens">
  <data key="d0">Siemens</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Siemens is the company that provides the SITRANS P family of pressure transmitters and related solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Company associated with the SITRANS pressure measurement products.&lt;SEP&gt;Siemens is the manufacturer of the SITRANS product range including the SITRANS LH100/LH300, SITRANS P300, and SITRANS FP differential pressure sensor.&lt;SEP&gt;Siemens is the manufacturer of the SITRANS pressure transmitter families SITRANS P420, SITRANS P320, SITRANS P300, and SITRANS P COMPACT.&lt;SEP&gt;Siemens is the company associated with the SITRANS product comparison and the SITRANS product family.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-572c717a6680b77ac4993917925a97b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6086d150f1c9fad29deb5294d8a5301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28929d6541ccd9fbfd6be3e69287bec9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcd5a3f5ccd64668dc63bd83e6959a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a54c7cc3fd1b24440332f3b903c96434</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059356</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SIMATIC PCS 7">
  <data key="d0">SIMATIC PCS 7</data>
  <data key="d1">controlsystem</data>
  <data key="d2">SIMATIC PCS 7 is a process control system that integrates seamlessly with SITRANS P pressure transmitters through specific faceplates and support from SIMATIC PDM.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-572c717a6680b77ac4993917925a97b7</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792058703</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SIMATIC PDM">
  <data key="d0">SIMATIC PDM</data>
  <data key="d1">controlsystem</data>
  <data key="d2">SIMATIC PDM (Process Device Manager) is a central maintenance station that provides special support for SITRANS P integration into SIMATIC PCS 7.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-572c717a6680b77ac4993917925a97b7</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792058703</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MindSphere">
  <data key="d0">MindSphere</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">MindSphere is an open cloud solution for comprehensive analysis, to which data from SITRANS P transmitters can be uploaded.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-572c717a6680b77ac4993917925a97b7</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792058704</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="HART">
  <data key="d0">HART</data>
  <data key="d1">controlsystem</data>
  <data key="d2">HART is a communication standard supported by SITRANS P transmitters for digital communication.&lt;SEP&gt;HART is a communication protocol mentioned as included in the preceding SITRANS table for other SITRANS products, not for SITRANS P200/210/220, LH100, or LH300.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-572c717a6680b77ac4993917925a97b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a54c7cc3fd1b24440332f3b903c96434</data>
