<node id="Remote Safety Handling">
  <data key="d0">Remote Safety Handling</data>
  <data key="d1">protectionsystem</data>
  <data key="d2">Remote safety handling is a capability of SITRANS P that enables centralized SIL commissioning and validation from the control desk without on-site device operation.&lt;SEP&gt;Safety handling feature supported by SITRANS P420 and cited for SITRANS P320.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-572c717a6680b77ac4993917925a97b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6086d150f1c9fad29deb5294d8a5301</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059367</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
