  <data key="d2">Industry included in SITRANS P320's industry list, omitted from SITRANS P420's list.&lt;SEP&gt;Water/wastewater is the target industry for the SITRANS LH100/LH300.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c6086d150f1c9fad29deb5294d8a5301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28929d6541ccd9fbfd6be3e69287bec9</data>
