<node id="SITRANS P220 :: Pressure Type">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS P220 :: Pressure Type</data>
  <data key="d1">operatingparameter</data>
  <data key="d2">SITRANS P220 measures gauge and absolute pressure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c6086d150f1c9fad29deb5294d8a5301</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059394</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SITRANS LH100, LH300">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS LH100, LH300</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">The SITRANS LH100 and LH300 are Siemens pressure transmitters with a slim design featuring a 23.4 mm diameter that allows installation in pipes with 1" inner diameter. They offer easy and safe installation even without a cable socket due to a built-in humidity filter in the cable, and are resistant to harsh environmental conditions due to a piezoresistive ceramic sensor. Their target industry is water/wastewater.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28929d6541ccd9fbfd6be3e69287bec9</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059394</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SITRANS FP Differential Pressure Sensor">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS FP Differential Pressure Sensor</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">The SITRANS FP differential pressure sensor is a flow solution using the differential pressure method. It is suitable for many applications even at high temperatures and high pressures, available as a pre-assembled compact system or as a separate version, with traceability and easy communication thanks to web-based product design, and QAL1 approval for emission monitoring applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28929d6541ccd9fbfd6be3e69287bec9</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059401</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Remote Seal">
  <data key="d0">Remote Seal</data>
  <data key="d1">component</data>
  <data key="d2">The Remote seal is an accessory for Siemens pressure transmitters offering high variance to meet all requirements of each industry and a wide range of diaphragm materials that ensure excellent chemical resistance to medium.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28929d6541ccd9fbfd6be3e69287bec9</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059407</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Valves And Valve Blocks">
  <data key="d0">Valves And Valve Blocks</data>
  <data key="d1">valve</data>
  <data key="d2">Valves and valve blocks are accessories for Siemens pressure transmitters that save time with a pre-mounted valve block, with the entire unit seal-tested for leaks under pressure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28929d6541ccd9fbfd6be3e69287bec9</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059408</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Accessories">
  <data key="d0">Accessories</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Accessories is a section divider category in the table covering remote seals, valves and valve blocks, and the SITRANS FP differential pressure sensor, which complement the Siemens pressure transmitter range.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28929d6541ccd9fbfd6be3e69287bec9</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059409</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Piezoresistive Ceramic Sensor">
  <data key="d0">Piezoresistive Ceramic Sensor</data>
  <data key="d1">component</data>
  <data key="d2">The piezoresistive ceramic sensor is a sensor used in the SITRANS LH100/LH300 that makes the device resistant to harsh environmental conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28929d6541ccd9fbfd6be3e69287bec9</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059409</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Humidity Filter">
  <data key="d0">Humidity Filter</data>
  <data key="d1">component</data>
  <data key="d2">The humidity filter is built into the cable of the SITRANS LH100/LH300, enabling easy and safe installation even without a cable socket.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28929d6541ccd9fbfd6be3e69287bec9</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059410</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SITRANS LH100, LH300 :: Diameter">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS LH100, LH300 :: Diameter</data>
  <data key="d1">operatingparameter</data>
  <data key="d2">The SITRANS LH100/LH300 has a slim design with a 23.4 mm diameter.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28929d6541ccd9fbfd6be3e69287bec9</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059411</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SITRANS LH100, LH300 :: Pipe Inner Diameter">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS LH100, LH300 :: Pipe Inner Diameter</data>
  <data key="d1">operatingparameter</data>
  <data key="d2">The SITRANS LH100/LH300 diameter of 23.4 mm allows installation in pipes with 1" inner diameter.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28929d6541ccd9fbfd6be3e69287bec9</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059411</data>
