<node id="Page 9 Technical Data Table">
  <data key="d0">Page 9 Technical Data Table</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">The Page 9 technical data table provides technical specifications for the SITRANS P300, including accuracy 0.075%, measuring span 10 mbar to 400 bar, max turndown 100:1, long-term stability 0.25%/5 years, medium temperature -40 °C to +200 °C, and ATEX/Exia/ib/FM/CSA/NEPSI approvals.</data>
