<node id="SITRANS P COMPACT">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS P COMPACT</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">SITRANS P COMPACT is a pressure transmitter for hygienic applications for measuring gauge and absolute pressure. SITRANS P COMPACT supports gauge pressure and absolute pressure; measuring span 0 bar to 40 bar; communication 4...20 mA and 0...20 mA; accuracy 0.2%; max. turndown not specified (-); long-term stability 0.2% / year; measured medium temperature -10 °C to +200 °C; certificates/approvals ATEX, Exib; diaphragm materials stainless steel.&lt;SEP&gt;SITRANS P COMPACT is a SITRANS pressure transmitter in the preceding Page 9 comparison table of high-performance and compact hygienic pressure transmitters.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bcd5a3f5ccd64668dc63bd83e6959a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a54c7cc3fd1b24440332f3b903c96434</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059425</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
