<node id="SITRANS Pressure Transmitter Comparison Table">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS Pressure Transmitter Comparison Table</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">The table is a 12-row by 5-column technical comparison for four Siemens SITRANS pressure transmitter families: SITRANS P420, SITRANS P320, SITRANS P300, and SITRANS P COMPACT, organized as a product-by-attribute matrix with rows for brief description, pressure types, measuring span, communication, accuracy, max. turndown, long-term stability, measured medium temperature, certificates/approvals, diaphragm materials, special features, and product URLs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bcd5a3f5ccd64668dc63bd83e6959a69</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059465</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SITRANS FP differential pressure sensor">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS FP differential pressure sensor</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">SITRANS FP differential pressure sensor measures differential pressure. It is a differential pressure sensor according to ISO 5167 (orifices) SITRANS FPS200 and pitot tube measuring system SITRANS FPS300 for flow measurement. Its communication is described as As P320 or available without pressure transmitter. Accuracy is 0.5% to 1.2% respectively 1% for Re &gt; 20,000. Measured medium temperature is according to EN 1092-1 / ASME B16.5, respectively -100 °C to +700 °C. Approvals are As P320, QAL 1. Diaphragm materials are stainless steel, carbon steel, hastelloy (not for membrane). Special features include nominal size DN 10 to DN 4000, pressure up to PN 100, and bidirectional measurement possible. No measuring span, max turndown, or long-term stability are listed in this excerpt.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a54c7cc3fd1b24440332f3b903c96434</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059470</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SITRANS FPS200">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS FPS200</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">SITRANS FPS200 is an orifice differential pressure sensor used according to ISO 5167 for flow measurement with the SITRANS FP differential pressure sensor.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a54c7cc3fd1b24440332f3b903c96434</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059471</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SITRANS FPS300">
  <data key="d0">SITRANS FPS300</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">SITRANS FPS300 is a pitot tube measuring system for flow measurement with the SITRANS FP differential pressure sensor.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a54c7cc3fd1b24440332f3b903c96434</data>
  <data key="d4">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792059474</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
