  <data key="d2">The Earlier SITRANS Table is the preceding Page 9 comparison table of SITRANS P420, P320, P300, and P COMPACT. It includes HART, PROFIBUS PA, FOUNDATION Fieldbus, and 0...20 mA communication for other SITRANS products and lists 100:1 max turndown for P420/P320/P300.</data>
