  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">The Legal Disclaimer is on Page 11 and states that descriptions and performance characteristics are not always binding and may change due to further product development, so the specifications in this table should be treated as brochure-level, not contractual, data unless expressly agreed.</data>
