<node id="Self-Contained Breathing Apparatus (SCBA)">
  <data key="d0">Self-Contained Breathing Apparatus (SCBA)</data>
  <data key="d1">protectionsystem</data>
  <data key="d2">Self-contained breathing apparatus is required for firefighters and when entering a release area unless the atmosphere is proved safe; SCBA is used while removing a victim to an uncontaminated area.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c202e5769aa4bdf573fb70310abc052a</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061224</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Firefighter Protective Equipment">
  <data key="d0">Firefighter Protective Equipment</data>
  <data key="d1">protectionsystem</data>
  <data key="d2">Standard protective equipment for firefighters includes flame retardant coat, helmet with face shield, gloves, rubber boots, and self-contained breathing apparatus (SCBA).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c202e5769aa4bdf573fb70310abc052a</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061224</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dry Inert Gas">
  <data key="d0">Dry Inert Gas</data>
  <data key="d1">substance</data>
  <data key="d2">Dry inert gas is used to purge the system before gas is introduced and when the system is placed out of service; examples include helium or nitrogen.&lt;SEP&gt;Dry inert gas, such as helium or nitrogen, is used to purge the system before gas is introduced and when the system is placed out of service.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c202e5769aa4bdf573fb70310abc052a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061224</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Helium">
  <data key="d0">Helium</data>
  <data key="d1">substance</data>
  <data key="d2">Helium is an example of a dry inert gas used for purging.&lt;SEP&gt;Helium is an example of a dry inert gas used for purging systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c202e5769aa4bdf573fb70310abc052a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061225</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
