  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Containers">
  <data key="d0">Containers</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">Containers which contain or have contained flammable or explosive substances must not be inerted with liquid carbon [text truncated].</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c202e5769aa4bdf573fb70310abc052a</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061226</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="System">
  <data key="d0">System</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">A system must be purged with dry inert gas before gas is introduced and when the system is placed out of service; air must be purged from the system before introducing gas.&lt;SEP&gt;The system is the gas handling installation which must be purged with dry inert gas before gas is introduced and when placed out of service, have air purged before introducing gas, be checked (or regularly checked) for leaks before use, and be handled as a closed system. Systems under pressure should be regularly checked for leakages.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c202e5769aa4bdf573fb70310abc052a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061226</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Adequate Ventilation">
  <data key="d0">Adequate Ventilation</data>
  <data key="d1">safetyrequirement</data>
  <data key="d2">Adequate ventilation is required for handling and accidental release; provide adequate ventilation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c202e5769aa4bdf573fb70310abc052a</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061226</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ignition Sources">
  <data key="d0">Ignition Sources</data>
  <data key="d1">safetyrequirement</data>
  <data key="d2">Ignition sources must be eliminated; keep away from heat, hot surfaces, sparks, open flames and other ignition sources; no smoking.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c202e5769aa4bdf573fb70310abc052a</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061227</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Explosive Atmospheres">
  <data key="d0">Explosive Atmospheres</data>
  <data key="d1">safetyrequirement</data>
  <data key="d2">The risk of potentially explosive atmospheres must be considered.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c202e5769aa4bdf573fb70310abc052a</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061227</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sewers, Basements And Workpits">
  <data key="d0">Sewers, Basements And Workpits</data>
  <data key="d1">plantarea</data>
  <data key="d2">Sewers, basements and workpits are places where released product must be prevented from entering because accumulation can be dangerous.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c202e5769aa4bdf573fb70310abc052a</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061228</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Special Fire Fighting Procedures">
  <data key="d0">Special Fire Fighting Procedures</data>
  <data key="d1">safetyrequirement</data>
  <data key="d2">In case of fire: stop leak if safe to do so; do not extinguish flames at leak because possibility of uncontrolled explosive re-ignition exists; continue water spray from protected position until container stays cool; use extinguishants to contain the fire; isolate the source of the fire or let it burn out.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c202e5769aa4bdf573fb70310abc052a</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061228</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Accidental Release Measures">
  <data key="d0">Accidental Release Measures</data>
  <data key="d1">safetyrequirement</data>
  <data key="d2">Evacuate area; provide adequate ventilation; consider the risk of potentially explosive atmospheres; eliminate all ignition sources; monitor the concentration of the released product; prevent from entering sewers, basements and workpits, or any place where accumulation can be dangerous; wear self-contained breathing apparatus (SCBA) when entering area unless atmosphere is proved to be safe.&lt;SEP&gt;Accidental release measures for Hydrogen require eliminating ignition sources and monitoring concentrations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c202e5769aa4bdf573fb70310abc052a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d9e3002c421208587ad06d75543e1ad</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061993</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Handling And Storage Precautions">
  <data key="d0">Handling And Storage Precautions</data>
  <data key="d1">safetyrequirement</data>
  <data key="d2">Only experienced and properly instructed persons should handle gases under pressure; use only properly specified equipment which is suitable for this product, its supply pressure and temperature; purge system with dry inert gas (e.g. helium or nitrogen) before gas is introduced and when system is placed out of service; purge air from system before introducing gas; containers which contain or have contained flammable or explosive substances must not be inerted with liquid carbon [text truncated].</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c202e5769aa4bdf573fb70310abc052a</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061229</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
