  <data key="d5">1792061250</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Transport Precautions">
  <data key="d0">Transport Precautions</data>
  <data key="d1">safetyrequirement</data>
  <data key="d2">Avoid transport on vehicles where the load space is not separated from the driver's compartment; ensure the vehicle driver is aware of the potential hazards and emergency procedures; secure product containers; ensure the container valve is closed and not leaking; place container valve guards or caps; ensure adequate air ventilation.&lt;SEP&gt;Precautions for transport of hydrogen, compressed: avoid transport on vehicles where the load space is not separated from the driver's compartment; ensure driver awareness of hazards; secure containers; close and check valves; use valve guards or caps; ensure adequate air ventilation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0c034b2641f77a2e80ced6c44548bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7444e8b9cda5407aac838fe2176791cc</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792062017</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
