<node id="Other Information">
  <data key="d0">Other Information</data>
  <data key="d1">safetyrequirement</data>
  <data key="d2">Before using Hydrogen, Compressed in any new process or experiment, a thorough material compatibility and safety study should be carried out; ensure adequate air ventilation; ensure all national/local regulations are observed; no liability for injury or damage resulting from its use can be accepted.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0c034b2641f77a2e80ced6c44548bcc</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061252</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
