  <data key="d5">1792061252</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Safety Data Sheet">
  <data key="d0">Safety Data Sheet</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">The safety data sheet for Hydrogen, Compressed contains sections on stability and reactivity, toxicological information, transport information, regulatory information, and other information.&lt;SEP&gt;The Safety Data Sheet is the SDS document containing sections for Hydrogen, including Section 1 Product Identity, Section 2.1 Classification, Section 2.2 Label Elements, Section 3 Composition, and Section 4 First Aid Measures.&lt;SEP&gt;The table is part of a controlled Safety Data Sheet for hydrogen, compressed, with revision date 28/11/2022.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0c034b2641f77a2e80ced6c44548bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34cab1cc532ba23dc6d6b8a72f15de19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7444e8b9cda5407aac838fe2176791cc</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061983</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Additional Information">
  <data key="d0">Additional Information</data>
  <data key="d1">safetyrequirement</data>
  <data key="d2">Additional information is a field of the safety data sheet for Hydrogen, Compressed; in Section 9.2 it is stated as None, and in Section 14.8 it presents the transport precautions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0c034b2641f77a2e80ced6c44548bcc</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061253</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Stability And Reactivity">
  <data key="d0">Stability And Reactivity</data>
  <data key="d1">safetyrequirement</data>
  <data key="d2">Stability and Reactivity is Section 10 of the safety data sheet for Hydrogen, Compressed, covering reactivity, chemical stability, possibility of hazardous reactions, conditions to avoid, incompatible materials, and hazardous decomposition products.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0c034b2641f77a2e80ced6c44548bcc</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061253</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Toxicological Information">
  <data key="d0">Toxicological Information</data>
  <data key="d1">safetyrequirement</data>
  <data key="d2">Toxicological Information is Section 11 of the safety data sheet for Hydrogen, Compressed, covering information on toxicological effects such as acute toxicity and other health endpoints.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0c034b2641f77a2e80ced6c44548bcc</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061254</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Regulatory Information">
  <data key="d0">Regulatory Information</data>
  <data key="d1">safetyrequirement</data>
  <data key="d2">Regulatory Information is Section 15 of the safety data sheet for Hydrogen, Compressed, covering safety, health and environmental regulations/legislation specific for the substance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0c034b2641f77a2e80ced6c44548bcc</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061254</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Safety, Health And Environmental Regulations/Legislation">
  <data key="d0">Safety, Health And Environmental Regulations/Legislation</data>
  <data key="d1">safetyrequirement</data>
  <data key="d2">Section 15.1 of the safety data sheet identifies safety, health and environmental regulations/legislation specific for Hydrogen, Compressed, and lists local legislation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0c034b2641f77a2e80ced6c44548bcc</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061255</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Local Legislation">
  <data key="d0">Local Legislation</data>
  <data key="d1">standard</data>
  <data key="d2">Local legislation applicable to Hydrogen, Compressed comprises the Dangerous Goods Ordinance (Chapter 295) and the Factories And Industrial Undertakings (Dangerous Substances) Regulation (Chapter 59AB).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0c034b2641f77a2e80ced6c44548bcc</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061255</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Container Valve">
  <data key="d0">Container Valve</data>
  <data key="d1">valve</data>
  <data key="d2">The valve on a gas container must be closed after each use and when empty, kept clean and free from contaminants such as oil and water, and reported to the supplier if damaged. It must never be repaired or modified.&lt;SEP&gt;The container valve is the valve of the container for Hydrogen, Compressed that must be closed and not leaking during transport.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0c034b2641f77a2e80ced6c44548bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061256</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Container Valve Guards Or Caps">
  <data key="d0">Container Valve Guards Or Caps</data>
  <data key="d1">component</data>
  <data key="d2">Container valve guards or caps are protective components that should be in place on the container for Hydrogen, Compressed during transport.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0c034b2641f77a2e80ced6c44548bcc</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061256</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Product">
  <data key="d0">Product</data>
  <data key="d1">substance</data>
  <data key="d2">The product is a colorless, odourless compressed gas supplied under pressure. It is a flammable gas with a relative density of 0.07 and is handled and stored in containers under strict safety precautions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061257</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Container">
  <data key="d0">Container</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">A container (cylinder) holds or has held the product gas. Containers must be protected from physical damage, secured upright, kept below 50°C, checked for leaks, and stored segregated from oxidants and away from heat and ignition sources.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061257</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Valve Protection Cap">
  <data key="d0">Valve Protection Cap</data>
  <data key="d1">component</data>
  <data key="d2">A protective cap left in place until the container is secured against a wall or bench or placed in a container stand and is ready for use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061257</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Valve Outlet Cap or Plug">
  <data key="d0">Valve Outlet Cap or Plug</data>
  <data key="d1">component</data>
  <data key="d2">Outlet caps or plugs supplied with the container must be replaced as soon as the container is disconnected from equipment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061258</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Container Cap">
  <data key="d0">Container Cap</data>
  <data key="d1">component</data>
  <data key="d2">A cap supplied for the container that is kept in place and replaced as soon as the container is disconnected from equipment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061258</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Valve Guard">
  <data key="d0">Valve Guard</data>
  <data key="d1">component</data>
  <data key="d2">A valve guard that should be in place on containers, including during storage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061258</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Safety Relief Device">
  <data key="d0">Safety Relief Device</data>
  <data key="d1">protectionsystem</data>
  <data key="d2">A safety relief device fitted to a container that must never be repaired or modified.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061259</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Non-Sparking Tool">
  <data key="d0">Non-Sparking Tool</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">Non-sparking tools must be used when handling the product to avoid ignition.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061259</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Trolley">
  <data key="d0">Trolley</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">A trolley is an appropriate device for moving containers, even for short distances.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061259</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hand Truck">
  <data key="d0">Hand Truck</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">A hand truck is an appropriate device for moving containers, even for short distances.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061260</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
