<node id="Fork Truck">
  <data key="d0">Fork Truck</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">A fork truck is an appropriate device for moving containers, even for short distances.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061260</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Gas Detector">
  <data key="d0">Gas Detector</data>
  <data key="d1">instrument</data>
  <data key="d2">Gas detectors should be used when quantities of flammable gases or vapours may be released.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061260</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Self Contained Breathing Apparatus (SCBA)">
  <data key="d0">Self Contained Breathing Apparatus (SCBA)</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">Self Contained Breathing Apparatus is worn where an inhalation risk exists.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061261</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Air-Line Respirator">
  <data key="d0">Air-Line Respirator</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">An Air-line respirator is worn where an inhalation risk exists.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061261</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Safety Glasses">
  <data key="d0">Safety Glasses</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">Eye protection in the form of safety glasses is required when handling the product.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061261</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Leather Gloves">
  <data key="d0">Leather Gloves</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">Hand protection in the form of leather gloves is required when handling the product.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061261</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Safety Boots">
  <data key="d0">Safety Boots</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">Body protection in the form of safety boots is required when handling the product.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061262</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Welded Pipe">
  <data key="d0">Welded Pipe</data>
  <data key="d1">pipe</data>
  <data key="d2">Permanent leak tight installations such as welded pipes must be used for the product handled in a closed system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061262</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Local Exhaust Ventilation">
  <data key="d0">Local Exhaust Ventilation</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">Adequate general and local exhaust ventilation must be provided to keep concentrations well below lower explosion limits and to ensure the occupational exposure limit is not exceeded.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061262</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Electrical Equipment">
  <data key="d0">Electrical Equipment</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">Electrical equipment in storage areas and areas of potentially explosive atmosphere must be compatible with the risk and usable in explosive atmospheres, and must be electrically earthed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061263</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Electrical Earthing">
  <data key="d0">Electrical Earthing</data>
  <data key="d1">protectionsystem</data>
  <data key="d2">Electrical earthing of equipment and electrical equipment must be provided as a precautionary measure against static discharges.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061263</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Liquid Carbon Dioxide">
  <data key="d0">Liquid Carbon Dioxide</data>
  <data key="d1">substance</data>
  <data key="d2">Liquid carbon dioxide must not be used to inert containers that contain or have contained flammable or explosive substances.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061263</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Oxidant Gas">
  <data key="d0">Oxidant Gas</data>
  <data key="d1">substance</data>
  <data key="d2">Oxidant gases and other oxidants being stored must be segregated from the product containers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061264</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Acid">
  <data key="d0">Acid</data>
  <data key="d1">substance</data>
  <data key="d2">Suckback of acid into the container must be avoided.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061264</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Alkali">
  <data key="d0">Alkali</data>
  <data key="d1">substance</data>
  <data key="d2">Suckback of alkalis into the container must be avoided.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061264</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Combustible Material">
  <data key="d0">Combustible Material</data>
  <data key="d1">substance</data>
  <data key="d2">Stored containers must be kept away from combustible material.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061265</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Safe Handling">
  <data key="d0">Safe Handling</data>
  <data key="d1">process</data>
  <data key="d2">Precautions for safe handling require that only experienced and properly instructed persons handle gases under pressure using properly specified equipment suitable for the product, its supply pressure and temperature.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061265</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Safe Storage">
  <data key="d0">Safe Storage</data>
  <data key="d1">process</data>
  <data key="d2">Conditions for safe storage require containers to be stored free from fire risk and away from heat and ignition sources, segregated from oxidants, protected from corrosion, and periodically checked for condition and leakage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061265</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Purging">
  <data key="d0">Purging</data>
  <data key="d1">process</data>
  <data key="d2">The system is purged with dry inert gas before gas is introduced and when placed out of service, and air is purged from the system before introducing gas.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061265</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Leak Checking">
  <data key="d0">Leak Checking</data>
  <data key="d1">process</data>
  <data key="d2">The complete system must be checked, or regularly checked, for leaks before use, and systems under pressure should be regularly checked for leakages.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061266</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Work Permit System">
  <data key="d0">Work Permit System</data>
  <data key="d1">controlsystem</data>
  <data key="d2">A work permit system, for example for maintenance activities, should be considered as an appropriate engineering control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061266</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ventilation">
  <data key="d0">Ventilation</data>
  <data key="d1">controlsystem</data>
  <data key="d2">Adequate air ventilation and adequate general and local exhaust ventilation must be ensured, and containers must be kept in a well ventilated place.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061267</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Local/Regional/National/International Regulations">
  <data key="d0">Local/Regional/National/International Regulations</data>
  <data key="d1">standard</data>
  <data key="d2">All regulations and local requirements regarding storage of containers must be observed, and storage must be in accordance with local, regional, national and international regulations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061267</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Supplier's Handling Instructions">
  <data key="d0">Supplier's Handling Instructions</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">The supplier's handling instructions must be referred to when handling the product; labels provided by the supplier for identification of container contents must not be removed or defaced, and damaged valves must be reported immediately to the supplier.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-360cb75b7b6c18d60b1c4f91e5d2a671</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061267</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
