  <data key="d1">operatingparameter</data>
  <data key="d2">Hydrogen purity is stated as ≥99.8% for Hydrogen, H2, CAS 1333-74-0, EC 215-605-7.&lt;SEP&gt;The purity of Hydrogen is specified as greater than or equal to 99.8% in the composition table of Section 3.1 Substances. This value indicates a high-purity compressed gas.</data>
