<node id="Hydrogen Safety Data Sheet">
  <data key="d0">Hydrogen Safety Data Sheet</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">The Hydrogen Safety Data Sheet is the document containing Section 3.1 Substances, Section 3.2 Mixtures, and compositional, regulatory, and hazard information for Hydrogen. Section 3.1 contains the composition table and product identity fields for Hydrogen, while Section 3.2 is listed as Not Applicable.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7d9e3002c421208587ad06d75543e1ad</data>
