  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Section 3.1 Substances">
  <data key="d0">Section 3.1 Substances</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">Section 3.1 'Substances' of the Hydrogen Safety Data Sheet appears before Section 3.2 'Mixtures'. Section 3.1 contains the product identity fields for Hydrogen and a simple four-column, one-row composition table with columns Ingredient(s), CAS No., EC no., and Purity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7d9e3002c421208587ad06d75543e1ad</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061989</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Section 3.2 Mixtures">
  <data key="d0">Section 3.2 Mixtures</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">Section 3.2 'Mixtures' of the Hydrogen Safety Data Sheet is listed as Not Applicable. This is consistent with the product being a single substance rather than a mixture.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7d9e3002c421208587ad06d75543e1ad</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061989</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Composition Table">
  <data key="d0">Composition Table</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">The composition table is a simple four-column, one-row table in Section 3.1 Substances. Its column headers are Ingredient(s), CAS No., EC no., and Purity. The single row identifies the ingredient as Hydrogen with CAS number 1333-74-0, EC number 215-605-7, and purity greater than or equal to 99.8%.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7d9e3002c421208587ad06d75543e1ad</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061990</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="H220 'Extremely Flammable Gas'">
  <data key="d0">H220 'Extremely Flammable Gas'</data>
  <data key="d1">safetyrequirement</data>
  <data key="d2">H220 is the hazard statement 'Extremely flammable gas', associated with Hydrogen's classification as Flammable gas Category 1.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7d9e3002c421208587ad06d75543e1ad</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061990</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="H280 'Contains Gas Under Pressure; May Explode If Heated'">
  <data key="d0">H280 'Contains Gas Under Pressure; May Explode If Heated'</data>
  <data key="d1">safetyrequirement</data>
  <data key="d2">H280 is the hazard statement 'Contains gas under pressure; may explode if heated', associated with Hydrogen's classification as Gases under pressure (Compressed gas).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7d9e3002c421208587ad06d75543e1ad</data>
  <data key="d4">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1792061991</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
