<node id="Product Identity Fields">
  <data key="d0">Product Identity Fields</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">The product identity fields for Hydrogen are provided in the safety data sheet and appear immediately before the composition table of Section 3.1 'Substances' and before Section 3.2 'Mixtures'. These fields state the chemical name Hydrogen, chemical formula H2, CAS no. 1333-74-0, and EC no. 215-605-7.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7d9e3002c421208587ad06d75543e1ad</data>
