  <data key="d2">A single-column, merged-cell SDS excerpt table encoded with colspan=2 rows and no explicit column headers; each row functions as a section or subsection label with its corresponding regulatory statement, covering Section 12: Ecological Information and Section 13: Disposal Considerations.</data>
