</edge>
<edge source="EL 4.0 :: Production Rate" target="EL 4.0 :: Nominal Power Consumption per Nm³ of H₂ Produced">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Nominal power consumption of 4.8 kWh/Nm³ is consistent with a production rate of about 0.5 Nm³/h.</data>
