<edge source="SITRANS P320" target="SITRANS P420">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">SITRANS P420 is described as the “high performance” version of SITRANS P320 for gauge and differential pressure measurements.&lt;SEP&gt;SITRANS P420 and SITRANS P320 both cite IEC61508 SIL2/3, NAMUR NE107 HMI, 4-key operation, remote safety handling, and digitalization readiness.&lt;SEP&gt;SITRANS P420 and SITRANS P320 share pressure types, measuring span, turndown, long-term stability, measured medium temperature, approvals, diaphragm materials, and communication; P420 has better accuracy (0.04% vs 0.065%) and the additional "ready for digitalization" feature.&lt;SEP&gt;SITRANS P420 is described as the "high performance" version of the P320 for gauge and differential pressure measurements.</data>
  <data key="d9">digital features,high_performance,is_version_of,product hierarchy,product_family,safety features,shares_features_with,shares_specifications,version relationship</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6086d150f1c9fad29deb5294d8a5301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcd5a3f5ccd64668dc63bd83e6959a69</data>
  <data key="d11">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792059565</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="SITRANS P320" target="SITRANS P320 :: Measuring Accuracy">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">SITRANS P320 has a high measuring accuracy of 0.065%.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f</data>
  <data key="d11">SITRANS-P-EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792058723</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="SITRANS P320" target="SITRANS P320 :: Measuring Span">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">SITRANS P320 has a measuring span of 1 mbar to 700 bar.&lt;SEP&gt;SITRANS P320 has a measuring span of 1 mbar to 700 bar.</data>
  <data key="d9">has_limit,has_parameter,measuring_span</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-bb1e7c7c76a4ad8b5e70402063940e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcd5a3f5ccd64668dc63bd83e6959a69</data>
