<edge source="Hydrogen, Compressed" target="Special Fire Fighting Procedures">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">In case of fire: stop leak if safe to do so; do not extinguish flames at leak because possibility of uncontrolled explosive re-ignition exists; continue water spray from protected position until container stays cool; use extinguishants to contain the fire; isolate the source of the fire or let it burn out.</data>
