<edge source="Hydrogen, Compressed" target="Self-Contained Breathing Apparatus (SCBA)">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">SCBA must be used by firefighters and when entering a release area unless the atmosphere is proved safe; SCBA is used while removing a victim to an uncontaminated area.</data>
  <data key="d9">requires,respiratory protection</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-c202e5769aa4bdf573fb70310abc052a</data>
  <data key="d11">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792061291</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hydrogen, Compressed" target="Firefighter Protective Equipment">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Firefighters must use standard protective equipment including flame retardant coat, helmet with face shield, gloves, rubber boots, and SCBA.</data>
  <data key="d9">protective equipment,requires</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-c202e5769aa4bdf573fb70310abc052a</data>
  <data key="d11">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792061292</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hydrogen, Compressed" target="Accidental Release Measures">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Evacuate area; provide adequate ventilation; consider the risk of potentially explosive atmospheres; eliminate all ignition sources; monitor the concentration of the released product; prevent from entering sewers, basements and workpits, or any place where accumulation can be dangerous; wear SCBA when entering area unless atmosphere is proved to be safe.</data>
  <data key="d9">emergency procedure,requires</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-c202e5769aa4bdf573fb70310abc052a</data>
  <data key="d11">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792061292</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hydrogen, Compressed" target="System">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Purge system with dry inert gas before gas introduction and when system is placed out of service; purge air from system before introducing gas.</data>
  <data key="d9">handling procedure,requires_purging_of</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-c202e5769aa4bdf573fb70310abc052a</data>
  <data key="d11">Hydrogen_compressed_Datasheet.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1792061294</data>
